        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Deltana SBIH2510, Solid Brass Intermediate Pivot Hinge Pair</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nIntermediate Pivot hinge for doors that require additional support. Used with <a href=\"/products/heavy-duty-pivot-hinge-for-doors-up-to-200-lbs-deltana-ph60\"><b>PH60 Pivot Hinges</b></a>. Available in 9 finish options.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-SBIH2510-specifcations.gif?v=1704354539\" width=\"565\" height=\"203\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Deltana SBIH2510 Specifcations\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Intermediate Pivot Hinge:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Leaf Height: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Leaf Width: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Leaf Thickness: 1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Width: 4-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Wood Screws: #12 x 1-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-SBIH2510-specifcations.pdf?v=1704262216\" target=\"new\"><b>Deltana SBIH2510 Hinge Specifications (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nWe offer different <a href=\"/pages/deltana-finish-colors\" target=\"new\">finishes</a>, but no matter which finish you choose, the base metal will still be <b>High Quality Solid Brass</b>.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Sold as a Pair (2 Hinges)</b>\r\n</p>",
